{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And oil.</b> He did not mention 'pure olive' because it is known; therefore 'for the light' according to custom. Now he mentioned that the donors shall bring their contributions, and whoever is skilled — they are the wise of heart in the craft — shall come and make. And he began with the Mishkan, for it is inclusive, and the Ohel is a covering over it. And he mentioned its covering, and it includes two coverings:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:40:33.109844725Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}